                      ParanoiaParanoia is the classic Unix adventure game, ported to OSK. I won't say too much more, except that I removed the random-number routines that were there and replaced them with my own. Also, as a note, if you go to compile this, you will need to use the -k=LCL option to generate 32-bit references to the data.Russell Hoffmanrh2y+@andrew.cmu.eduCarnegie Mellon University